{"id":"636a259d-2c68-4fa2-8d03-89437ee468f4","rule_id":"428e9109-dc13-4ae9-84cb-100464d4c6fa","name":"【默认】Linux系统账号异常登录","immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"version":8,"revision":8,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T06:09:18.211Z","updated_by":"elastic","created_at":"2026-09-07T03:13:38.484Z","created_by":"elastic","enabled":true,"interval":"5m","from":"now-9m","to":"now","description":"检测系统类账号（如 daemon、bin、www-data 等）出现登录行为。对应需求：登录审计。","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","规则来源: 默认","用例: 身份与访问审计","对应需求: 登录审计"],"author":["Elastic"],"license":"Elastic License v2","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1078.003","name":"Local Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/003/"}]},{"id":"T1098","name":"Account Manipulation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1098.004","name":"SSH Authorized Keys","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/004/"}]}]},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Stealth","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1564","name":"Hide Artifacts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1564/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1564.002","name":"Hidden Users","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1564/002/"}]}]},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1078.003","name":"Local Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/003/"}]}]}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","host.id","user.name","user.id","source.ip","source.port","event.action","event.outcome","event.category","message","event.original","related.user","related.ip","agent.id"]},"related_integrations":[{"package":"system","version":">=2.0.0"}],"required_fields":[{"name":"event.action","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"event.category","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"event.outcome","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"host.os.type","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"user.name","type":"keyword","ecs":true}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend** 与/或 **System** / **auditd**（按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n3. 可用演示脚本做触发验证。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n系统账号发生登录。\n\n### 为何重要\n系统账号通常不应交互登录，高度可疑。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 立即隔离会话。\n2. 检查账号 Shell 与密码状态。\n3. 排查后门。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚变更、禁用相关账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后身份类告警。\n","false_positives":["极少数合法服务需要交互登录（应严格审批）"],"references":["https://blog.exatrack.com/Perfctl-using-portainer-and-new-persistences/","https://x.com/RFGroenewoud/status/1875112050218922010"],"risk_score":47,"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity":"medium","severity_mapping":[],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","output_index":"","max_signals":100,"exceptions_list":[],"actions":[],"type":"new_terms","query":"event.category:authentication and host.os.type:linux and event.action:(\"ssh_login\" or \"user_login\") and\nuser.name:(\n  \"deamon\" or \"bin\" or \"sys\" or \"games\" or \"man\" or \"lp\" or \"mail\" or \"news\" or \"uucp\" or \"proxy\" or \"www-data\" or \"backup\" or\n  \"list\" or \"irc\" or \"gnats\" or \"nobody\" or \"systemd-timesync\" or \"systemd-network\" or \"systemd-resolve\" or \"messagebus\" or\n  \"avahi\" or \"sshd\" or \"dnsmasq\"\n) and event.outcome:success\n","new_terms_fields":["user.name","host.id"],"history_window_start":"now-5d","index":["filebeat-*","logs-system.auth-*"],"language":"kuery"}
